 "description": "The new Antares flagship remains true to the identity and heritage established by its predecessors. The Antares 12 has taken a remarkable step forward in terms of equipment, comfort on board, feeling of space and elegance. Wherever you go, everyone recognises the boat’s style and your family will love its versatility.",
