   "kind": "text-images-slider",
   "id": null,
   "title": "Exterior design",
   "intro": "With a stylishly modern look, the Antares 12 showcases forward-thinking design while underlining the profile and mindset that have made the line so successful in the last 45 years.\nThe sheer line and hull windows create an elegant line and bring ample natural light inside. The iconic hard top profile blends well with the rest of the boat and is the foundation for the large flybridge.\nThe boat has three outdoor lounge areas: the cockpit, the forward sun pad and a vast flybridge with a corner sofa and a fully fitted outdoor galley cabinet.",
